CURRENT EXTRACTION TARGET - ACTIVE
Classification: members only.

Present objective: the Six-Tails (Saiken) host, a wandering missing-nin last sighted
in the coastal reaches of the Land of Water. The host travels without escort, which
makes acquisition preferable to a fortified-village assault.

Assigned: pursuit and containment by the nearest available cell; Zetsu tracking the
target's movements and reporting sightings to the Leader. On capture the host is to
be delivered alive to the Gedo Statue chamber; a dead host complicates the seal.

Following this beast, attention shifts toward the two heavily guarded hosts (Eight-
and Nine-Tails), which the Leader has ordered held for last. Do not deviate to those
targets without direct instruction.

Report all sightings through the standard cut-out couriers. Do not engage prematurely.
